    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.20
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Los costos de aumentar la rareza en el Ensamblador se han reducido
        a la mitad."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Rarity upgrade costs in the Assembler have been halved."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.21
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Tu nave ya no puede destruirse en la flota, as\xED que reaparecer
        siempre es seguro."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Your ship can no longer be destroyed at the fleet, so respawns
        are always safe."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.22
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Antorcha criog\xE9nica y Conducto cin\xE9tico ya est\xE1n a
        la venta en la nave nodriza."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Cryo Torch and Kinetic Conduit are now available for sale
        in the mothership."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.23
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Velocidad del Orbe rel\xE1mpago de Mj\xF6lnir aumentada un 40%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Increased speed of Mj\xF6lnir's Lightning Orb by 40%."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.24
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Regeneraci\xF3n de casco del Broodnest Species-XI reducida un
        25%."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Reduced Hull Regen of Species-XI Broodnest by 25%."
