    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Los preajustes de dificultad cambian da\xF1o por naves m\xE1s
        resistentes, m\xE1s enemigos y m\xE1s salvamento."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Difficulty presets trade damage for tougher ships, more
        enemies, more salvage."
