  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Demo End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: kavk7l86
      type: 9
      value: Demo completada
      baseValue: Demo Complete
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Sp3qc7xG
      type: 8
      value: "\xA1Felicidades, has completado la demo!\n\n<color=#89bcde>\xA1El juego
        completo ya est\xE1 disponible en acceso anticipado! Lo consigas o no, me
        encantar\xEDa saber qu\xE9 te pareci\xF3 la demo en nuestro Discord.</color>\n\n<color=#5776a0>Las
        partidas guardadas se transferir\xE1n al juego completo para que tu aventura
        pueda continuar.</color>"
      baseValue: 'Congrats, you have completed the demo!


        <color=#89bcde>The
        full game is now out in Early Access! Whether you grab it or not, I''d love
        to hear what you thought of the demo in our Discord.</color>


        <color=#5776a0>Player
        saves will transfer to the full game so your adventure can continue.</color>'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 5dynyIZW
      type: 9
      value: "Ver p\xE1gina de la tienda"
      baseValue: View Store Page
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Scene.Game.Early Access End Canvas
    entries:
    - key: sd1yGGyy
      type: 9
      value: 'Acceso anticipado: historia en progreso'
      baseValue: 'Early Access: Story In Progress'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: M2TRKJpM
      type: 8
      value: "El avance de la historia est\xE1 en pausa... por ahora.\n\nHas alcanzado
        el l\xEDmite actual del contenido de historia en Acceso Anticipado. M\xE1s
        historia y sistemas est\xE1n en desarrollo.\n\nPuedes seguir jugando en <color=#FB6330>New
        Game+</color>, reiniciando las misiones y volviendo al Sector 1 con un nivel
        m\xE1s alto mientras conservas tu nave, mejoras y objetos."
      baseValue: 'Story progression paused... for now.


        You''ve reached
        the current limit of story content in Early Access. More story and systems
        are in development.


        You can continue playing in <color=#FB6330>New
        Game+</color>, resetting missions and returning to Sector 1 at a higher level
        while keeping your ship, upgrades, and items.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: WBmB4joN
      type: 8
      value: "New Game+ es opcional. Una vez iniciado, esta elecci\xF3n es permanente
        y no podr\xE1s volver a este nivel."
      baseValue: New Game+ is optional. Once started, this choice is permanent and
        you cannot return to this level.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vRuztZBk
      type: 9
      value: Iniciar New Game+
      baseValue: Start New Game+
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
