  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Tutorial Helper
    entries:
    - key: OG7Lffb1
      type: 18
      value: Puedes usar tu rayo tractor para arrastrar contenedores de objetos cercanos.
      baseValue: You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby item containers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D4tpv9Eg
      type: 18
      value: "Puedes girar, acelerar y estabilizar tu nave usando los controles a
        continuaci\xF3n."
      baseValue: You can turn, accelerate and stabilize your ship using the controls
        below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GgnYo5Si
      type: 18
      value: "Mant\xE9n presionada la tecla de esquivar y presiona en cualquier direcci\xF3n
        para esquivar y evitar a los enemigos."
      baseValue: Hold the dodge key and press any direction to dodge and avoid enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8ksGCocz
      type: 18
      value: "Mant\xE9n presionado el modificador de esquivar y mu\xE9vete en una
        direcci\xF3n para esquivar en esa direcci\xF3n."
      baseValue: Hold down the dodge modifier and move in a direction to dodge that
        way.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 40aaJoXo
      type: 18
      value: "Usa el bot\xF3n de impulso si necesitas llegar a alg\xFAn lugar r\xE1pidamente."
      baseValue: Use the boost button if you need to get somewhere quickly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A3xhd830
      type: 18
      value: "Las armas primarias generan calor cuando se usan, el sobrecalentamiento
        las desactivar\xE1."
      baseValue: Primary weapons generate heat when used, overheating will disable
        them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8yy9WQ8e
      type: 18
      value: Activa el modo torreta para apuntar tus armas independientemente de
        tu nave.
      baseValue: Toggle turret mode to aim your weapons independently from your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qjFmgpCP
      type: 18
      value: "Puedes apuntar por separado desde tu nave usando los controles que
        aparecen a continuaci\xF3n."
      baseValue: You can aim separately from your ship using the controls below.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YOcC3mqm
      type: 18
      value: "El panel principal contiene mejoras, equipo, misiones y navegaci\xF3n."
      baseValue: The core panel contains upgrades, equipment, missions and navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D8bNqsfe
      type: 18
      value: "Dispara a uno de los asteroides cercanos para practicar punter\xEDa."
      baseValue: Shoot one of the nearby asteroids for target practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mtEKYWW3
      type: 18
      value: "Has completado una misi\xF3n. Puedes reclamarla en el <color=#ffc600>Panel
        de misiones</color>."
      baseValue: You have completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission
        Panel</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jXjkzH27
      type: 18
      value: "Mu\xE9vete hacia la nave nodriza y presiona <color=#ffc600>interactuar</color>
        para atracar."
      baseValue: Move toward the mothership and press <color=#ffc600>interact</color>
        to dock.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: sfgfxbnx
      type: 18
      value: "Puedes saltar con el hiperimpulsor entre enfrentamientos para viajar
        m\xE1s r\xE1pido."
      baseValue: You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Xg6o3rEX
      type: 18
      value: Coloca la <color=#ffc600>Piedra angular del sector</color> en el portal
        del sector en <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      baseValue: Place the <color=#ffc600>Sector Keystone</color> into the Secor
        Gateway at <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xwPjwzi8
      type: 18
      value: "La <color=#ffc600>Resistencia del escudo</color> te har\xE1 inmune
        a los debuffs de ese tipo."
      baseValue: <color=#ffc600>Shield Resistance</color> will make you immune to
        debuffs of that type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: r6IBC7w9
      type: 18
      value: Ahora puedes desbloquear una ranura adicional en el panel de <color=#ffc600>Mejoras</color>.
      baseValue: You can now unlock an additional slot in the <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
        panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hPHo23Bg
      type: 18
      value: "Hay clases de nave adicionales disponibles en <color=#ffc600>Dise\xF1o
        de Nave</color> en la <color=#ffc600>Nave Nodriza</color>."
      baseValue: Additional ship classes are available in <color=#ffc600>Ship Design</color>
        at the <color=#ffc600>Mothership</color>.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ArqiBaTi
      type: 18
      value: Puedes enlazar ranuras de <color=#DB5656>Arma Secundaria</color> y <color=#7756DB>Especial</color>
        en el panel de equipo.
      baseValue: You can link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
        slots in the equipment panel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hmkSTF8r
      type: 18
      value: Impulsarse a alta velocidad te hace <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        y desactiva las armas.
      baseValue: Boosting at high speed makes you <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        and disables weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vAJLXeSx
      type: 18
      value: "Abre el <color=#ffc600>Panel de navegaci\xF3n</color> para localizar
        el Ensamblador en el mapa del sector."
      baseValue: Open the <color=#ffc600>Navigation Panel</color> to locate the Assembler
        on the sector map.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Yl7Tc7Bv
      type: 18
      value: "Los puntos de ruta son <color=#ffc600>desbloqueos permanentes</color>
        y a\xFAn se puede saltar a ellos despu\xE9s de que el sector se regenere."
      baseValue: Waypoints are <color=#ffc600>permanent unlocks</color> and can still
        be jumped to after the sector is regenerated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: FFlVzdh8
      type: 18
      value: "Usa la <color=#ff441b>Semilla Infectada</color> en un <color=#ffc600>Punto
        de ruta</color> si quieres luchar contra m\xE1s enemigos Species-XI."
      baseValue: Use the <color=#ff441b>Infected Seed</color> on a <color=#ffc600>Waypoint</color>
        if you want to fight more Species-XI enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
