      type: 10
      value: "Puerto {0} abierto autom\xE1ticamente: tu partida acepta conexiones
        directas."
      baseValue: Port {0} opened automatically - your game accepts direct connections.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatPortClosed
      type: 10
      value: "No se pudo abrir el puerto {0} en tu router: para unirse por direcci\xF3n
        IP puede que haya que redirigir el puerto manualmente."
      baseValue: Couldn't open port {0} on your router - joining by IP address may
        need the port forwarded manually.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatListedReachable
      type: 10
      value: "Tu partida est\xE1 en la lista p\xFAblica de servidores y acepta conexiones
        directas en el puerto {0}."
      baseValue: Your game is on the public server list and accepts direct connections
        on port {0}.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatFriendsListedReachable
      type: 10
      value: Tu partida es visible para tus amigos de Steam y acepta conexiones directas
        en el puerto {0}.
      baseValue: Your game is visible to your Steam friends and accepts direct connections
        on port {0}.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatPortOpenedBlocked
      type: 10
      value: "Se abri\xF3 el puerto {0} en tu router, pero internet sigue sin poder
        alcanzarlo: probablemente lo est\xE9 bloqueando tu ISP o un segundo router."
      baseValue: Port {0} was opened on your router but the internet still cannot
        reach it - your ISP or a second router is probably blocking it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatPortClosedBlocked
      type: 10
      value: No se pudo abrir el puerto {0} en tu router e internet no puede alcanzarlo.
      baseValue: Couldn't open port {0} on your router and the internet cannot reach
        it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinSteamAndHelper
      type: 10
      value: "Los jugadores de Steam a\xFAn pueden unirse a trav\xE9s de Steam, y
        los dem\xE1s mediante el asistente de conexi\xF3n de star-vortex.com, pero
        nadie puede unirse por direcci\xF3n IP."
      baseValue: Steam players can still join through Steam and others through the
        star-vortex.com connection helper, but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinSteamOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Los jugadores de Steam a\xFAn pueden unirse a trav\xE9s de Steam, pero
        el asistente de conexi\xF3n de star-vortex.com no respondi\xF3, as\xED que
        nadie m\xE1s puede unirse."
      baseValue: Steam players can still join through Steam, but the star-vortex.com
        connection helper did not answer, so nobody else can join.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Los jugadores de la lista de partidas a\xFAn pueden unirse mediante
        el asistente de conexi\xF3n de star-vortex.com (funciona con la mayor\xEDa
        de los routers), pero nadie puede unirse por direcci\xF3n IP."
      baseValue: Players from the game list can still join through the star-vortex.com
        connection helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsHelperOnly
      type: 10
      value: "Tus amigos de Steam a\xFAn pueden unirse mediante el asistente de conexi\xF3n
        de star-vortex.com (funciona con la mayor\xEDa de los routers), pero nadie
        puede unirse por direcci\xF3n IP."
      baseValue: Your Steam friends can still join through the star-vortex.com connection
        helper (works with most routers), but nobody can join by IP address.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinNone
      type: 10
      value: "El asistente de conexi\xF3n de star-vortex.com tampoco respondi\xF3,
        as\xED que tu partida no pudo aparecer en la lista y nadie puede unirse.
        Para solucionarlo, redirige el puerto UDP {0} manualmente."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your game could not be listed and nobody can join. Forward UDP port {0} manually
        to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HUDChat.chatJoinFriendsNone
      type: 10
      value: "El asistente de conexi\xF3n de star-vortex.com tampoco respondi\xF3,
        as\xED que tus amigos de Steam no pueden ver tu partida y nadie puede unirse.
        Para solucionarlo, redirige el puerto UDP {0} manualmente."
      baseValue: The star-vortex.com connection helper did not answer either, so
        your Steam friends cannot see your game and nobody can join. Forward UDP
        port {0} manually to fix this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
