      baseValue: Leave Session
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: WorldController
    entries:
    - key: worldController.introDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Mantengan la l\xEDnea! \xA1Mantengan esas cosas alejadas de la
        nave nodriza!"
      baseValue: Hold the line! Keep those things off the mothership!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Se acercan m\xE1s enemigos. Actualmente nos superan en n\xFAmero cinco
        a uno."
      baseValue: More hostiles approaching. They currently outnumber us five to one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Esto no se ve bien...
      baseValue: This isn't looking good...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Se\xF1al an\xF3mala detectada. Es... un transpondedor proveniente de
        una nave abandonada. Su alcance es... este rango no deber\xEDa ser posible."
      baseValue: Anomalous signal detected. It's... a transponder coming from a derelict
        vessel. Its distance is... this range shouldn't be possible.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.5
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFUn naufragio? \xBFEst\xE1s seguro?"
      baseValue: A shipwreck? Are you sure?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.6
      type: 2
      value: "Positivo. La intensidad de la se\xF1al sugiere que es real. Pero no
        deber\xEDamos poder detectarla a este alcance."
      baseValue: Positive. Signal strength suggests it's real. But we shouldn't be
        able to detect it at this range.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.introDialog.7
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1El alcance es bueno! Fija rumbo de inmediato. Te seguiremos."
      baseValue: Distance is good! Set course immediately. We'll follow your lead.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Necesitamos abrirnos paso por este sector para encontrar las piedras
        angulares del sector.
      baseValue: We need to work our way through this sector to find the Sector Keystones.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelNavigationDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: La nave puede realizar hipersaltos entre enfrentamientos conectados
        mientras exploras.
      baseValue: The ship can hyperjump between connected encounters as you explore.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Bienvenido al sistema de mejoras. Intenta no romper nada.
      baseValue: Welcome to the upgrade system. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Sube de nivel para ganar puntos de mejora. Cada 10 niveles, obtienes
        una nueva ranura para arma.
      baseValue: Level up to earn upgrade points. Every 10 levels, you get a shiny
        new weapon slot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Las naves m\xE1s grandes comienzan a desbloquearse a los 15... suponiendo
        que sobrevivas tanto tiempo."
      baseValue: Bigger ships start to unlock at 15... assuming you survive that
        long.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelUpgradesDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ninguna elecci\xF3n es permanente. Puedes restablecerlo todo gratis."
      baseValue: No choices are permanent. You can reset it all for free.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Nueva ranura para arma desbloqueada. Intenta no desperdiciarla.
      baseValue: New weapon slot unlocked. Try not to waste it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.corePanelSlotUnlockedDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Necesitar\xE1s acoplarte a la nave nodriza para actualizar el dise\xF1o
        de tu nave. Me abstendr\xE9 de juzgarla... en voz alta."
      baseValue: You'll need to dock with the mothership to update your ship design.
        I'll refrain from judging it... loudly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseLevelDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Gasta cr\xE9ditos aqu\xED para subir el nivel de un objeto. Las estad\xEDsticas
        mejoran, as\xED que tu equipo antiguo no se queda atr\xE1s."
      baseValue: Spend credits here to raise an item's level. Stats improve, so yer
        old gear doesn't fall behind.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelIncreaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Aumenta la rareza de un objeto sacrificando uno m\xE1s fuerte del mismo
        tipo. Una mayor rareza significa m\xE1s margen para modificadores, sin perder
        lo que ya tienes."
      baseValue: Boost an item's rarity by sacrificing a stronger one of the same
        kind. Higher rarity means more room for modifiers, without losing what ya've
        already got.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.assemblerPanelReplaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Esto te permite quitar un modificador de un objeto y pegarlo en otro.
        Cuesta cr\xE9ditos y, a menos que sea un esquema, la chatarra del donante
        despu\xE9s."
      baseValue: This lets ya lift a modifier off one item and stick it on another.
        Costs credits, and unless it's a schematic, the donor's scrap after.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarSkirmishDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Algunas naves enemigas est\xE1n interfiriendo con los portales. \xA1Elimina
        esas naves para continuar!"
      baseValue: Some of the enemy ships are disrupting the gateways. Eliminate those
        ships to proceed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarWarzoneDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Varios enemigos se acercan a tu posici\xF3n. \xA1No te preocupes, enviar\xE9
        refuerzos!"
      baseValue: Multiple enemies closing on your position. Don't worry, I'll send
        reinforcements to assist!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarRescueDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "El hiperimpulsor de nuestro aliado est\xE1 da\xF1ado. \xA1Defi\xE9ndelo
        hasta que pueda volver a funcionar!"
      baseValue: Our ally's hyperdrive is damaged. Defend them until they can get
        it back online!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarInterceptDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos interceptado un grupo de naves de transporte con carga valiosa.
        \xA1Destr\xFAyelas antes de que escapen con ella!"
      baseValue: We've intercepted a group of transport ships carrying valuable cargo.
        Destroy them before they escape with it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarTraderDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Las naves mercantes como esta no toman partido. Aunque no estamos en
        posici\xF3n de discutir."
      baseValue: Trading vessels like this don't take sides. Not that we're in any
        position to argue.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstStarEliteDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Elimina a los enemigos r\xE1pidamente, un enemigo de \xE9lite se acerca."
      baseValue: Eliminate the enemies quickly, an elite foe is incoming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.increaseRarityDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Ahora s\xED, est\xE1s ascendiendo en la galaxia! Tr\xE1eme tu equipo
        y mejorar\xE9 su rareza. \xA1Hag\xE1moslo brillar!"
      baseValue: Well now, yer movin' up in the galaxy! Bring me yer gear, and I'll
        upgrade it's rarity. Let's make it shine!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.replaceModifierDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bien, aqu\xED hay algo nuevo. Ahora puedo transferir modificadores
        entre equipos. Seamos creativos, \xBFeh?"
      baseValue: Right, here's something new. I can transfer modifiers between equipment
        now. Let's get creative, eh?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "La visibilidad es deficiente. Se est\xE1n activando los extractores
        de aire."
      baseValue: Visibility is suboptimal. Activating exhaust vents.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Mucho mejor. Si lo deseas, puedes volver a cerrarlas para ocultarlas.
      baseValue: Much better. You can toggle them back closed if you wish to hide.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFComo un cobarde?"
      baseValue: Like a coward?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstNebulaDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Nooo, como un depredador acechando a su presa! Aunque no puedo
        disparar ni acelerar sin abrirlas."
      baseValue: Nooo, like a predator, stalking their prey! I can't fire weapons
        or boost without opening them though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisMoltenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Se detectaron asteroides fundidos. La colisi\xF3n causar\xE1 da\xF1o
        t\xE9rmico, lo que inflige da\xF1o t\xE9rmico prolongado y aumenta r\xE1pidamente
        la temperatura de la nave. El da\xF1o t\xE9rmico se amplifica en esta regi\xF3n."
      baseValue: Molten asteroids detected. Collision will apply Burning, dealing
        thermal damage over time and rapidly increasing ship heat. Thermal damage
        is amplified in this region.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisFrozenAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Campo de escombros congelados m\xE1s adelante. El impacto puede infligir
        congelamiento, lo que reduce la velocidad y el rendimiento del arma en un
        cincuenta por ciento, a la vez que drena el calor r\xE1pidamente. El da\xF1o
        por fr\xEDo aumenta en esta zona."
      baseValue: Frozen debris field ahead. Impact may inflict Frozen, reducing speed
        and weapon output by fifty percent while draining heat quickly. Cold damage
        is enhanced in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisRadioactiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hay asteroides radiactivos. La colisi\xF3n genera da\xF1o radiactivo
        acumulativo que traspasa los escudos. Evita impactos repetidos. El da\xF1o
        por radiaci\xF3n se amplifica en esta zona."
      baseValue: Radioactive asteroids present. Collision applies stacking Radioactive
        damage that bypasses shields. Avoid repeated impacts. Radiation damage is
        amplified in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisCorrosiveAsteroidsDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Se detectaron escombros corrosivos. El impacto causa corrosi\xF3n,
        lo que permite a los enemigos asestarte un golpe cr\xEDtico. El da\xF1o corrosivo
        aumenta en esta \xE1rea."
      baseValue: Corrosive debris detected. Impact causes Corroding, allowing enemies
        to critical strike you. Corrosive damage is increased in this area.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: worldController.firstDebrisInvaderNebulaDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Part\xEDculas de Vac\xEDo detectadas. El contacto activar\xE1 Quemaduras,
        infligiendo da\xF1o t\xE9rmico prolongado y aumentando el calor. No las atravieses
        innecesariamente."
      baseValue: Void particles detected. Contact will trigger Burning, applying
        thermal damage over time and increasing heat. Do not fly through them unnecessarily.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
