  - categoryName: Resource.FixedStar
    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: Alpha Saxa
      baseValue: Alpha Saxa
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: Astralis
      baseValue: Astralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Ya era hora de que viera una cara amiga! \xBFD\xF3nde est\xE1 el
        viejo Gid?"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Novus Prime... te enviar\xE9 las coordenadas."
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "El hiperimpulsor est\xE1 funcionando mal... esa maldita cosa tiene
        mente propia. Necesitar\xE9 un poco de tiempo. Mant\xE9n a esos hostiles
        lejos de m\xED, \xBFquieres?"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tu incursi\xF3n termina aqu\xED. \xA1Est\xE1s irremediablemente superado!"
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "No estar\xEDa tan seguro de eso."
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Todas las naves, concentren el fuego en la Ciudadela. \xA1Esto termina
        aqu\xED!"
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "El casco est\xE1 a punto de ceder. Estoy despejando a la tripulaci\xF3n...
        ahora te toca a ti."
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Buen trabajo. Ahora, ve a colocar esa piedra angular en el portal del
        sector. \xA1A\xFAn no hemos terminado!"
      baseValue: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Infernum
      baseValue: Infernum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Esa es una serpiente grande...
      baseValue: That's a big snake...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Te ahorrar\xE9 la broma obvia..."
      baseValue: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.name
      type: 5
      value: Anochecer
      baseValue: Nightfall
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Malditos sectarios. Apuesto a que creen en los extraterrestres.
      baseValue: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFTe perdiste a todos los extraterrestres con los que hemos estado
        luchando?"
      baseValue: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Olvidados quedan los recuerdos del futuro!"
      baseValue: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Da igual. Simplemente no tomes nada de su Kool-Aid.
      baseValue: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gkWSs2X1.name
      type: 5
      value: Novus Prime
      baseValue: Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: z8m42dFQ.name
      type: 5
      value: Periculum
      baseValue: Periculum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.name
      type: 5
      value: Serenidad
      baseValue: Serenity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1No puedes quitarme el cielo!"
      baseValue: You can't take the sky from me!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFDe qu\xE9 est\xE1s hablando?"
      baseValue: What are you talking about?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Solo algo de una de las series de televisi\xF3n que conserv\xE9."
      baseValue: Just something from one of the TV series I kept.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Voy a mostrarte un mundo sin pecado.
      baseValue: I'm going to show you a world without sin.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFVes? Entendi\xF3 la referencia..."
      baseValue: See? He got the reference...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.name
      type: 5
      value: Virenum
      baseValue: Virenum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Estoy detectando niveles peligrosamente altos de radiaci\xF3n."
      baseValue: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFNo es eso simplemente el espacio en general?"
      baseValue: Isn't that just space in general?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esto es m\xE1s alto de lo normal. Esa nave est\xE1 derram\xE1ndola
        por todos lados."
      baseValue: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Genial. Justo lo que necesit\xE1bamos..."
      baseValue: Great. Just what we needed...
