      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Una nave del Conclave... inesperado. \xBFVienes a ver c\xF3mo es realmente
        la libertad?"
      baseValue: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Voy a donde necesito ir.
      baseValue: I go where I need to.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Entonces mira bien. Esto es lo que el Conclave teme, lo que nunca podr\xEDa
        controlar."
      baseValue: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it
        could never control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Estos tipos me caen bien...
      baseValue: I kind of like these guys...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.name
      type: 5
      value: "Bifr\xF6st"
      baseValue: "Bifr\xF6st"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Oh, mira! Doble problema. Una pareja que forma equipo... \xA1igual
        que nosotros!"
      baseValue: Oh, look! Double trouble. A pair teaming up... just like us!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Me pregunto cu\xE1l es el cerebro..."
      baseValue: I wonder which one is the brains...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: W48tqWIi.name
      type: 5
