      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cargas hacia el Prism como todos los conquistadores antes que t\xFA...
        ciego ante lo que no comprendes."
      baseValue: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Disculpas por la demora...
      baseValue: Apologies for the delay...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Una vez m\xE1s a la brecha, todas las naves al ataque!"
      baseValue: Once more unto the breach, all ships engage!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "No aguantaremos mucho m\xE1s. Me estoy alejando. No dejes que esto
        sea en vano."
      baseValue: We won't hold together much longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let
        this be for nothing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Otro enemigo derrotado. \xA1Bien hecho! Vamos a cargar ese portal del
        sector."
      baseValue: Another enemy vanquished. Well done. Let's get that sector gateway
        charged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Solo un sector m\xE1s nos separa de la Tierra."
      baseValue: Only one more sector stands between us and Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Un sector lleno de plantas...
      baseValue: A sector full of plants...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPlantas? Ah, s\xED, la flora... preciosa..."
      baseValue: Plants? Oh right, the Flora... lovely...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.name
      type: 5
      value: "T\xE1rtaro"
      baseValue: Tartarus
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Los secretos del Phantom ahora son nuestros. V\xE1yanse... o ser\xE1n
