      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Es rojo, ESA. \xBFCu\xE1ndo ha significado \xABbueno\xBB el rojo?"
      baseValue: It's red, ESA. When has red ever meant 'good'?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZIZW21Vn.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: La salsa es roja. Las fajitas necesitan salsa. Caso cerrado.
      baseValue: Salsa is red. Fajitas need salsa. I rest my case.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.name
      type: 5
      value: Verdara
      baseValue: Verdara
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: VaQoeakc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sea cual sea el resultado, tu fin es seguro. Si no por nuestras espinas,
        entonces por quien agita el vac\xEDo."
      baseValue: No matter the outcome, your end is certain. If not by our thorns,
        then by the one who stirs the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Gid est\xE1 hablando con el Gran Mariscal, as\xED que soy tu refuerzo.
        No te preocupes, traje bocadillos y explosivos."
      baseValue: Gid's chatting to the Grand Marshal, so I'm your backup. Don't worry,
        I brought snacks and explosives.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VaQoeakc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1No aguanto m\xE1s! Me retiro... \xA1Que valga la pena!"
      baseValue: Can't take much more o' this! I'm withdrawin'... make it count!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
