  - categoryName: Resource.MissionBase
    entries:
    - key: yMzJ40ae.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Llegada no deseada
      baseValue: Unwelcome Arrival
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.desc
      type: 8
      value: Species-XI ha llegado al sector.
      baseValue: Species-XI have arrived in the sector.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Maldita sea. Si est\xE1n atacando tan lejos, significa que la Tierra
        ya est\xE1 en peligro. Tenemos que volver y advertirles."
      baseValue: Damn. If they're attacking this far out, it means Earth is already
        at risk. We need to get back and warn them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Recuperamos una de sus semillas infectadas. T\xF3mala, tal vez puedas
        aprender algo de ella."
      baseValue: We recovered one of their infected seeds. Take it, you might be
        able to learn something from it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: La semilla infectada que llevas puede usarse para infectar un punto
        de referencia.
      baseValue: The infected seed you carry can be used to infect a waypoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Eso suena a una idea terrible...
      baseValue: That sounds like a terrible idea...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Convocar\xEDa a m\xE1s de ellos, s\xED. Pero solo enfrent\xE1ndolos
        aprender\xE1s a derrotarlos."
      baseValue: It would summon more of them, yes. But only by facing them will
        you learn to defeat them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Una mala idea
      baseValue: A Bad Idea
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Echo cree que podr\xEDas usar la semilla infectada para infectar una
        estructura de punto de referencia. Los encontrar\xE1s en tu viaje."
      baseValue: Echo thinks you could use the Infected Seed to infect a waypoint
        structure. You'll find them on your journey.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un movimiento audaz... El Emperador querr\xE1 respuestas si esto sale
        mal."
      baseValue: A bold move... The Emperor will want answers if this goes wrong.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Para que quede claro, esto fue completamente idea tuya.
      baseValue: Just so we're clear, this was entirely your idea.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activar portal
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.desc
      type: 8
      value: Activa el portal del sector en Novus Prime.
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: Excelente, puedes usar esa piedra angular en el portal del sector en
        Novus Prime.
      baseValue: Excellent, you can use that keystone in the sector gateway at Novus
        Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Portal del sector activado.
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "El portal del sector est\xE1 activo. Una vez m\xE1s perforando el vac\xEDo...
        tecnolog\xEDa m\xE1s antigua que la mayor\xEDa de los que viven hoy, sus
        secretos perdidos en el tiempo."
      baseValue: The sector gateway is active. Once more piercing the void... technology
        older than most who now live, its secrets lost to time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFEl vac\xEDo? De ah\xED vino Species-XI..."
      baseValue: The void? That's where Species-XI came from...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "De donde vinieron muchas cosas y donde muchas se perdieron. Los portales
        te proteger\xE1n... su luz brilla intensamente."
      baseValue: Where many things came from, and where many are lost. The gateways
        will shield you... its light burns bright.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Eso... ni siquiera apareci\xF3 en nuestros sensores."
      baseValue: That... didn't even show up on our sensors.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Es como si estuviera desfasada con nuestra realidad. Debe venir del
        vac\xEDo."
      baseValue: It's like she's out of phase with our reality. She must be from
        the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Por ahora nuestros objetivos est\xE1n alineados. Somos demasiado grandes
        para pasar, pero si contin\xFAas, usaremos tu se\xF1al para triangular tu
        posici\xF3n y seguirte."
      baseValue: For now our objectives align. We're too large to fit through, but
        if you proceed, we'll use your signal to triangulate your position and follow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Buenas noticias: hemos hecho ingenier\xEDa inversa de las naves Skeran.
        Ahora puedes integrar sus partes en tu dise\xF1o."
      baseValue: Some good news, we have reverse-engineered the Skeran ships. You
        can now integrate their parts into your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Basilisco
      baseValue: Basilisk
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye al Basilisco.
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: Hemos localizado la segunda piedra angular. La tiene el Basilisk Skeran.
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's held by the Skeran Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "La ubicaci\xF3n est\xE1 marcada en tu panel de navegaci\xF3n. Ac\xE9rcate
        con cuidado y aseg\xFArate de estar preparado."
      baseValue: The location has been marked on your navigation panel. Approach
        carefully and ensure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Behemoth
      baseValue: Behemoth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye al Behemoth.
