      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos rastreado una de las piedras angulares y marcado su ubicaci\xF3n
        en tu panel de navegaci\xF3n. Recup\xE9rala y tr\xE1ela aqu\xED."
      baseValue: We've tracked down one of the keystones and marked its location
        in your navigation panel. Retrieve it and bring it back here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Eliminaci\xF3n de basura"
      baseValue: Junk Disposal
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Destruye la nave Bull de \xE9lite usada por los Junkers."
      baseValue: Destroy the elite Bull ship used by the Junkers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: Has entrado en espacio Junker. Desertores, piratas, y cosas peores.
      baseValue: You've entered Junker space. Deserters, pirates, and worse.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Su buque insignia est\xE1 cerca. Destr\xFAyelo y romperemos su dominio
        sobre este cintur\xF3n. T\xFA decides... pero los Junkers no caen f\xE1cilmente."
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Destroy it, and we break their hold on
        this belt. Your call... but Junkers don't go down easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Citadel
      baseValue: Citadel
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: xytKXsHs.desc
      type: 8
      value: Ha llegado la hora de destruir la Citadel.
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Citadel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos localizado la \xFAltima piedra angular. \xA1Se conserva en la
        Citadel Skeran!"
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the location of the final keystone. It's kept in
        the Skeran Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "La Citadel est\xE1 fuertemente fortificada. Es el coraz\xF3n de las
        operaciones Skeran en esta regi\xF3n, as\xED que espera fuerte resistencia."
      baseValue: The Citadel is heavily fortified. It's the heart of Skeran operations
        in this region, so expect heavy resistance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "La he marcado en tu panel de navegaci\xF3n. Este es el \xFAltimo paso
        para activar por completo el portal del sector, aseg\xFArate de estar preparado."
      baseValue: I've marked it on your navigation panel. This is the last step to
        fully activate the sector gateway, make sure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Expulsado
      baseValue: Cast Out
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localiza y destruye al Griffin de \xE9lite usado por los Outcast."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Griffin used by the Outcasts.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1s entrando en territorio Outcast. El abuso de motores temporales
        los ha destrozado. Ten cuidado."
      baseValue: You're entering Outcast territory. Their abuse of Temporal Drives
        has broken them. Tread carefully.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Su buque insignia est\xE1 cerca. Derr\xEDbalo y su dominio aqu\xED
        podr\xEDa flaquear."
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Take it down, and their grip here may falter.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Llegar a Novus Prime
      baseValue: Reach Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.desc
      type: 8
      value: Escolta la flota a Novus Prime.
      baseValue: Escort the fleet to Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excelente trabajo. Estuvo cerca... demasiado cerca. Dudo que alguien
        m\xE1s pudiera habernos sacado de ah\xED."
      baseValue: Excellent work. That was close... too close. I doubt anyone else
        could've got us out of that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Tenemos que volver a la Tierra inmediatamente y advertir al Emperador
        sobre este nuevo enemigo.
      baseValue: We need to return to Earth immediately and warn the Emperor about
        this new enemy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Extra\xF1o. Los sistemas del hiperimpulsor est\xE1n operativos, pero...
        no podemos trazar un rumbo directo a la Tierra."
      baseValue: Strange. Hyperdrive systems are operational, but... we can't plot
        a direct course back to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9? \xBFPor qu\xE9 no?"
      baseValue: What? Why not?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "Desconocido. Los datos de navegaci\xF3n parecen estar... corruptos."
      baseValue: Unknown. Navigation data appears... corrupted.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: "Ese es un problema grave. \xBFPodr\xEDa ser el enemigo el responsable?"
      baseValue: That's a serious problem. Could the enemy be responsible?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.6
      type: 2
      value: El enemigo se llama Species-XI.
      baseValue: The enemy are called Species-XI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.7
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFC\xF3mo lo sabes?"
      baseValue: How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.8
      type: 2
      value: "Una extra\xF1a entidad blanca brillante nos dijo..."
      baseValue: A strange glowing white entity told us...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.9
      type: 2
      value: Ya veo... Eso no es precisamente tranquilizador.
      baseValue: I see... That's not exactly reassuring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.10
      type: 2
      value: "Tambi\xE9n dijo que dej\xF3 esta nave para nosotros."
      baseValue: She also said she left this ship for us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.11
      type: 2
      value: "Anotado. Por ahora, dir\xEDgete al portal del sector en Novus Prime.
        Hablaremos m\xE1s all\xED."
      baseValue: Noted. For now, head toward the sector gateway at Novus Prime. We'll
        talk more there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.12
      type: 2
      value: "Antes de irnos, tienes una recompensa de misi\xF3n por recoger. Prioridades,
        al fin y al cabo."
      baseValue: Before we leave, you have a mission reward to collect. Priorities,
        after all.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1 bien, salgamos de aqu\xED antes de que aparezcan m\xE1s criaturas
        extra\xF1as."
      baseValue: All right, let's get out of here before more strange creatures appear.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Oh, mira eso, unos locales amistosos!"
      baseValue: Oh, look at that, some friendly locals!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Entrega tu nave o muere!"
      baseValue: Surrender your ship, or die!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Correcci\xF3n: no es amigable. Definitivamente no es amigable."
      baseValue: 'Correction: not friendly. Definitely not friendly.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: Claramente, esas naves no contaban con el beneficio de una IA de combate
        avanzada.
      baseValue: Clearly, those ships didn't have the benefit of advanced combat
        AI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pasemos a Novus Prime antes de que aparezcan m\xE1s."
      baseValue: Let's move on to Novus Prime before more of them show up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Gran trabajo tray\xE9ndonos hasta aqu\xED. Este es el portal del sector,
        estableceremos un campamento y mantendremos la posici\xF3n."
      baseValue: Great work leading us here. This is the sector gateway, we'll establish
        camp and hold the position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ac\xF3plate a la nave nodriza. Tenemos m\xE1s cosas que hablar."
      baseValue: Dock with the mothership. We've got more to discuss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "Aqu\xED puedes comprar y vender objetos, as\xED como reparar, mejorar
        y redise\xF1ar tu nave."
      baseValue: You can buy and sell items here as well as repair, upgrade, and
        redesign your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "Este portal del sector nos acercar\xE1 un paso m\xE1s a la Tierra."
      baseValue: This sector gateway will take us one step closer to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: Sin embargo, las fuerzas Skeran en este sector tienen las tres piedras
        angulares necesarias para alimentarlo.
      baseValue: The Skeran forces in this sector hold the three keystones needed
        to power it though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "Empezar\xE9 a rastrearlas. Mientras tanto, tengo otra tarea para ti.
        Cuando te desacoples, actualizar\xE9 tu navegaci\xF3n."
      baseValue: I'll start tracking them down. In the meantime, I have another task
        for you. When you undock I'll update your navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "Deber\xEDas editar el dise\xF1o de la nave antes de desacoplarla. No
        queremos que alguien la confunda con basura espacial."
      baseValue: You should edit the ship's design before undocking. Wouldn't want
        someone to mistake it for space junk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Rescatar al ensamblador
      baseValue: Rescue the Assembler
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.desc
      type: 8
      value: "El ingeniero Relios se ha desviado del rumbo. Encu\xE9ntralo y rescata
        su nave."
      baseValue: Engineer Relios has strayed off course. Find him and rescue his
        ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Correcto! Relios pilotaba el Ensamblador, pero la se\xF1al de su
        transpondedor est\xE1 a cierta distancia."
      baseValue: Right! Relios was flying the Assembler but his transponder signal
        is some distance away.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Debe haberse desviado del rumbo. Local\xEDzalo y tr\xE1elo de vuelta."
      baseValue: He must have gone off course. Track him down and bring him back
        here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Buen trabajo! El Ensamblador est\xE1 de vuelta con nosotros."
      baseValue: Good work! That's the Assembler back with us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1S\xED, gracias por el rescate! Si vuelves y te acoplas al Ensamblador,
        \xA1puedo aumentarte el nivel del equipo!"
      baseValue: Aye, thanks for the save! If you come back and dock with the Assembler
        I can boost the level of equipment for ya!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Viajar al Sector 2
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 2
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Viaja a trav\xE9s del portal al Sector 2."
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 2.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Este lugar se siente fr\xEDo... Bueno, en realidad no puedo sentir,
        pero las lecturas de temperatura son abismalmente bajas."
      baseValue: This place feels cold... Well, I can't actually feel, but the temperature
        readings are abysmally low.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFNo es fr\xEDo todo el espacio?"
      baseValue: Isn't all space cold?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "M\xE1s fr\xEDo. Todo es relativo, \xBFrecuerdas?"
      baseValue: Cold-er. Everything's relative, remember?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Aqu\xED viene el viejo..."
      baseValue: Here comes the old guy...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activar portal
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.desc
      type: 8
      value: Activa el portal del sector en Genesis.
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos llegado al portal del sector, pero est\xE1 desconectado otra
        vez. Los Phantom controlan las piedras angulares de este."
      baseValue: We've reached the sector gateway, but it's offline again. The Phantoms
        control the keystones for this one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ya hemos empezado a rastrear sus ubicaciones. Mantente alerta, esto
        no ser\xE1 f\xE1cil."
      baseValue: We've already begun tracking down their locations. Stay sharp, this
        won't be easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Portal del sector activado.
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: 'Ya conoces el procedimiento: salta y te triangularemos.'
      baseValue: You know the drill, jump through and we'll triangulate on you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Las naves Phantom tambi\xE9n quedaron sometidas a ingenier\xEDa
        inversa! Ahora puedes usar sus partes en tu dise\xF1o."
      baseValue: That's the Phantom ships reverse-engineered as well! You can now
        use their parts in your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: No esperaba verte junto al Crystal Prism...
      baseValue: Didn't expect to see you along side the Crystal Prism...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Cada pieza del tablero se mueve por una raz\xF3n."
      baseValue: Every piece on the board moves for a reason.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFY de qu\xE9 lado juegas t\xFA?"
      baseValue: And which side are you playing?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Los lados son para aquellos que no pueden ver el juego completo.
      baseValue: Sides are for those who can't see the whole game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Baldur y Hodr
      baseValue: Baldur and Hodr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye a Baldur y Hodr.
      baseValue: Find and destroy Baldur and Hodr.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La segunda piedra angular est\xE1 custodiada por Baldur y una nave
        Pantheon, Hodr. Tendremos que destruirlos a ambos para asegurarla."
      baseValue: The second keystone is guarded by Baldur and a Pantheon vessel,
        Hodr. We'll need to destroy them both to secure it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Curar el Blight
      baseValue: Cure The Blight
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localiza y destruye al Blight de \xE9lite usado por los Shadow."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Blight used by the Shadow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hay un buque insignia Shadow escondido aqu\xED que se ha infiltrado
        en el espacio Phantom."
      baseValue: There's a Shadow flagship hiding here that's infiltrated Phantom
        space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Eliminarlo debilitar\xEDa su presencia... pero la decisi\xF3n es tuya."
      baseValue: Taking it out would weaken their presence... but the decision is
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Crystal Prism
      baseValue: Crystal Prism
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.desc
      type: 8
      value: Ha llegado la hora de destruir el Crystal Prism.
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Crystal Prism.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "El Crystal Prism es un nexo de poder en este sector. Contiene la \xFAltima
        piedra angular que necesitamos."
      baseValue: The Crystal Prism is a nexus of power in this sector. It holds the
        final keystone we need.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Horizonte de sucesos
      baseValue: Event Horizon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localiza y destruye al Horizon de \xE9lite usado por los Pantheon."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Horizon used by the Pantheon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La nave Pantheon Horizon est\xE1 delante. Se separaron del Conclave
        persiguiendo ideales... no el caos."
      baseValue: The Pantheon vessel Horizon is ahead. They broke from the Conclave
        chasing ideals... not chaos.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Los ideales no excusan la traici\xF3n. El Emperador lo dej\xF3 claro.
        Entra en combate si es necesario."
      baseValue: Ideals don't excuse treason. The Emperor made that clear. Engage
        if you must.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Mjolnir
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Encuentra y destruye a Mj\xF6lnir."
      baseValue: "Find and destroy Mj\xF6lnir."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Detect\xE9 una sobrecarga de energ\xEDa masiva... lo suficiente para
        fre\xEDr una flota. Resulta que viene de una nave llamada Mj\xF6lnir. Te
        apuesto una pinta a que ah\xED est\xE1 la piedra angular."
      baseValue: "Picked up a massive power surge... strong enough to fry a fleet.
        Turns out, it's comin' from a ship called Mj\xF6lnir. Bet ya a pint that's
        where the keystone is."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Viaje a G\xE9nesis"
      baseValue: Travel to Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.desc
      type: 8
      value: Localiza el siguiente portal del sector en Genesis.
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Pens\xE9 en acompa\xF1arte esta vez... asegurarme de que no te pierdas.
        No podemos dejar que vayas a la deriva hacia una roca congelada, \xBFverdad?"
      baseValue: Thought I'd tag along this time... make sure ya don't get lost.
        Can't have ya driftin' off into some frozen rock, now can we?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Excelente. Eso ahorrar\xE1 tiempo en la misi\xF3n de rescate."
      baseValue: Excellent. That'll save time on the rescue mission.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Los Phantom no ver\xE1n con buenos ojos nuestra presencia. Pero es
        un paso m\xE1s cerca de la Tierra."
      baseValue: Phantoms won't take kindly to our presence. But it's one step closer
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nuestro pr\xF3ximo objetivo es el portal del sector en Genesis."
      baseValue: Our next objective is the sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "Por supuesto, no ser\xE1 tan sencillo como simplemente presentarse."
      baseValue: Of course, it won't be as simple as just showing up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: Nunca lo es...
      baseValue: It never is...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Viajar al Sector 3
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 3
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Viaja a trav\xE9s del portal al Sector 3."
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 3.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Sector 3...donde hasta las plantas quieren matarnos.
      baseValue: Sector 3... where even the plants want to kill us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFLa Flora? No los conoc\xEDa antes."
      baseValue: The Flora? I've not met them before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nos ven como destructores corruptos de la naturaleza. Lo cual, siendo
        justos... es bastante cierto. Pero tambi\xE9n, grosero."
      baseValue: They see us as corrupt destroyers of nature. Which, to be fair...
        is mostly accurate. But also, rude.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activar portal
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.desc
      type: 8
      value: Activa el portal del sector en Eden.
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Estamos lo suficientemente cerca del Sector 4 como para que pueda atravesar
        la interferencia. Si el Gran Mariscal sigue vivo, lo sabr\xE9 pronto."
      baseValue: We're close enough to Sector 4 now that I might be able to break
        through the interference. If the Grand Marshal's still alive, I'll find out
        soon enough.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Mientras tanto, ya sabes c\xF3mo funciona. Ese portal no se va a abrir
        solo. Rastrea las piedras angulares y por fin podremos saltar a casa."
      baseValue: Meanwhile, you know the drill. That gateway isn't going to open
        itself. Track down the keystones, and we can finally make the jump home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Portal del sector activado. Las coordenadas est\xE1n fijadas para nuestro
        regreso a la Tierra."
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated. Coordinates are locked for our return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Me tomar\xEDa un whisky o dos antes de enfrentarme al Gran Mariscal
        Vex en persona. Quiz\xE1s tres."
      baseValue: I'd grab a whisky or two before facing Grand Marshal Vex in person.
        Maybe three.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Cuidado. \xC9l no es de los que aprecian tu... encanto."
      baseValue: Careful. He's not the sort to appreciate your... charm.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Bueno, aqu\xED vamos. Tierra, Vex y lo que quede de la fiesta de bienvenida."
      baseValue: Well, here goes nothing. Earth, Vex, and whatever's left of the
        welcome party.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Intenta sonre\xEDr. Podr\xEDa ascenderte... o vaporizarte. De cualquier
        manera, memorable."
      baseValue: Try to smile. He might promote you... or vaporize you. Either way,
        memorable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Los componentes que reclam\xE9 formar\xE1n el n\xFAcleo de algo m\xE1s
        grande."
      baseValue: The components I claimed will form the core of something greater.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, \xBFqu\xE9 es eso?"
      baseValue: Oh, what's that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Un arma. Una dise\xF1ada para silenciar el vac\xEDo."
      baseValue: A weapon. One designed to silence the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Y ahora...lo construimos juntos.
      baseValue: And now... we build it together.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9 aquello me pareci\xF3 menos un regalo y m\xE1s un ultim\xE1tum
        velado?"
      baseValue: Why did that feel less like a gift and more like a veiled ultimatum?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: Ya no intento descifrarla. Vayamos a la Tierra, luego nos ocuparemos
        de ello.
      baseValue: I'm done trying to figure her out. Let's get to Earth then we'll
        deal with it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Bloodroot
      baseValue: Bloodroot
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: qSzuRLOd.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye a Bloodroot.
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Bloodroot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos localizado la segunda piedra angular. Est\xE1 incrustada en una
        enorme nave Flora de vides retorcidas y hojas rojas ardientes. Elim\xEDnala
        y recupera la piedra angular."
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's embedded in a massive Flora
        vessel twisted vines, burning red leaves. Eliminate it and retrieve the keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFLo ves? Incluso los guardianes de la vida pueden sangrar. Las ra\xEDces
        de esta galaxia se est\xE1n pudriendo... y t\xFA eres el fuego que necesita."
      baseValue: You see? Even the guardians of life can bleed. The roots of this
        galaxy are rotting... and you're the fire it needs.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Hice lo que ten\xEDa que hacer. La flota necesita esa piedra angular."
      baseValue: I did what I had to. The fleet needs that keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Por supuesto. \xD3rdenes dadas, \xF3rdenes cumplidas. Un arma tan confiable..."
      baseValue: Of course. Orders given, orders followed. Such a reliable weapon...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Ll\xE9vame con tu l\xEDder"
      baseValue: Take Me to Your Leader
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localiza y destruye al Cortex de \xE9lite usado por los Grays."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Cortex used by the Grays.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "As\xED que... aqu\xED es donde se han estado escondiendo. Estamos muy
        lejos de Marte..."
      baseValue: So... this is where they've been hiding. We're a long way from Mars...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "S\xED, y por lo que parece, atrincherados profundamente. Hay un Cortex
        escondido ah\xED dentro."
      baseValue: Aye, and dug in deep from the looks of it. There's a Cortex hiding
        in there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ese buque insignia es la ra\xEDz del asunto. Derr\xEDbalo y cortamos
        su alcance."
      baseValue: That flagship of theirs is the root of it. Take it out, and we cut
        off their reach.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "La verdad est\xE1 ah\xED fuera"
      baseValue: The Truth is Out There
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.desc
      type: 8
      value: Destruye la sonda enemiga que te ha estado siguiendo.
      baseValue: Destroy the enemy probe that has been following you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bueno, mira eso... una sonda extra\xF1a decidi\xF3 seguirnos. Los esc\xE1neres
        indican que es m\xE1s resistente de lo que parece."
      baseValue: Well, look at that... some weird probe decided to tail us. Scans
        indicate it's tougher than it looks.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un Cifrado de Portal. Supongo que abrir\xE1 ese portal bloqueado que
        encontramos antes."
      baseValue: A Gateway Cipher. Guessing that'll open that locked gateway we found
        earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Lumenveil
      baseValue: Lumenveil
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 920RNPlS.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye el Lumenveil.
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Lumenveil.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Detect\xE9 un resplandor que se ver\xEDa desde aqu\xED. La nave se
        llama Lumenveil. Estoy casi seguro de que ese brillo esconde una piedra angular."
      baseValue: Picked up a glow you could see from here. Ship's called Lumenveil.
        Pretty sure that sparkle's hiding a keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Viajar a Eden
      baseValue: Travel to Eden
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.desc
      type: 8
      value: Localiza el siguiente portal del sector en Eden.
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sabes, Gid... despu\xE9s de todo esto, estoy pensando que podr\xEDa
        retirarme, establecerme en alg\xFAn lugar y tal vez empezar un jard\xEDn."
      baseValue: You know, Gid... after all this, I'm thinkin' I might retire, settle
        down somewhere, maybe start a garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "No pens\xE9 que fueras del tipo de persona que se dedica a la jardiner\xEDa."
      baseValue: Didn't take you for the gardening type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9 tan dif\xEDcil puede ser la jardiner\xEDa, eh? Mientras
        las plantas no est\xE9n armadas."
      baseValue: How hard can gardening be, eh? Long as the plants ain't armed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "En este sector... quiz\xE1s sea mucho pedir. Estamos a un salto del
        portal del sector en Eden, \xA1vamos!"
      baseValue: In this sector... that might be too much to ask. We're just one
        jump away from the Sector gateway at Eden, let's go!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Viajar al Sector 4
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Viaja a trav\xE9s del portal al Sector 4."
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 4.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Almirante Gideon. Informe.
      baseValue: Admiral Gideon. Report.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Volvimos y no estamos solos.
      baseValue: We made it back and we are not alone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Lo s\xE9. La criatura lleg\xF3 primero y ya est\xE1 trabajando."
      baseValue: I know. The creature arrived first and is already at work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ella lo llam\xF3 un arma y dice que \xABsilenciar\xE1 el vac\xEDo\xBB."
      baseValue: She called it a weapon and says it will "silence the void".
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: Ella evita los detalles.
      baseValue: She avoids specifics.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: "El Emperador me ha dado plena autoridad para defender la Tierra. Tomar\xE9
        cualquier arma que pueda usar."
      baseValue: The Emperor has given me full authority to defend Earth. I will
        take any weapon I can use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.6
      type: 2
      value: Una flota Skeran acaba de atravesar el borde exterior.
      baseValue: A Skeran fleet just breached the outer rim.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.7
      type: 2
      value: "S\xED... destruimos su Ciudadela en el camino."
      baseValue: Yeah... we destroyed their Citadel on the way through.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.8
      type: 2
      value: Nos ocuparemos de ellos.
      baseValue: We'll deal with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFAlguna vez tu raza se pregunt\xF3 por qu\xE9 los portales de tu
        sector natal convergen en tu planeta?"
      baseValue: Did your race ever wonder why the gateways in your home sector converge
        on your planet?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFLos Architects?"
      baseValue: The Architects?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: Exactamente. Los Architects dieron forma a este sector alrededor de
        su hogar, no del tuyo.
      baseValue: Exactly. The Architects shaped this sector around their home, not
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Heredaste su mundo, su tecnolog\xEDa y sus pecados."
      baseValue: You inherited their world, their technology, and their sins.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "Terminar\xE9 lo que ellos empezaron. Mant\xE9n el sector hasta que
        el arma est\xE9 completa."
      baseValue: I will finish what they started. Hold the sector until the weapon
        is complete.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Veredicto
      baseValue: Verdiction
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.desc
      type: 8
      value: Ha llegado la hora de destruir el Verdiction.
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Verdiction.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: Hemos localizado el Verdiction. La nave capital de la Flora.
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the Verdiction. The Flora's capital ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "As\xED que este es el piloto que mencionaste."
      baseValue: So this is the pilot you mentioned.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "No hay tiempo para cortes\xEDas. Destruye el Verdiction. Luego vuelve
        a la Tierra de inmediato."
      baseValue: No time for pleasantries. Destroy the Verdiction. Then return to
        Earth immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Vaya. Y yo que pensaba que era yo el que carec\xEDa de unidades emocionales."
      baseValue: Huh. And here I thought I was the one missing emotional units.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "El Verdiction ha ca\xEDdo. Aceptable."
      baseValue: The Verdiction is gone. Acceptable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Cumpliste tu parte. Ahora term\xEDnala. Activa el portal y vuelve a
        la Tierra."
      baseValue: You've done your part. Now finish it. Activate the gateway and return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Claro. Quiz\xE1s la medalla llegue despu\xE9s... o algo as\xED."
      baseValue: Sure. Maybe the medal comes later... or something.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Luz cegadora
      baseValue: Blinding Light
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localiza y destruye al Vibrance de \xE9lite usado por los Forgotten."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Vibrance used by the Forgotten.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La facci\xF3n Forgotten est\xE1 liderada por un buque insignia llamado
        Vibrance."
      baseValue: The Forgotten faction is led by a flagship called Vibrance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Destruirlo pondr\xEDa fin a su cruzada."
      baseValue: Destroying it would end their crusade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Defiendan la Tierra
      baseValue: Defend Earth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.desc
      type: 8
      value: Destruye ambas naves capitales atacantes.
      baseValue: Destroy both attacking capital ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: Tarea completada. Volver a la flota.
      baseValue: Task complete. Return to the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Inspirador como siempre...
      baseValue: Inspirational as always...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "La \xABcriatura\xBB indica que el dispositivo ya puede activarse."
      baseValue: The "creature" indicates the device can now be activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFConf\xEDas en ella?"
      baseValue: Do you trust it?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "No tenemos opci\xF3n. Todas las naves, prep\xE1rense para la activaci\xF3n..."
      baseValue: We don't have a choice. All ships, prepare for activation...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Leviat\xE1n"
      baseValue: Leviathan
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Encuentra y destruye al Leviat\xE1n."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Leviathan.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Una nave Species-XI de clase Leviathan tambi\xE9n se dirige hacia la
        Tierra. Interc\xE9ptala y destr\xFAyela antes de que llegue."
      baseValue: A Leviathan-class Species-XI vessel is also inbound for Earth. Intercept
        and destroy it before it arrives.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "El Leviathan ha ca\xEDdo... has enorgullecido a la flota."
      baseValue: The Leviathan has fallen... you've done the fleet proud.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Zyraxx
      baseValue: Zyraxx
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: rOWbIQCL.desc
      type: 8
      value: Encuentra y destruye a los Zyraxx.
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Zyraxx.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La flota Shadow est\xE1 liderada por una nave conocida como la Zyraxx.
        Dale caza."
      baseValue: The Shadow fleet is led by a vessel known as the Zyraxx. Hunt it
        down.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Ja! \xA1Destrozaste esa cosa... buen trabajo!"
      baseValue: Ha! Ye tore that thing apart... fine work!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Tutorial
      baseValue: Tutorial
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: lgHw7KNB.desc
      type: 8
      value: Aprende a controlar tu nave mientras esperas a la flota.
      baseValue: Learn to control your ship while waiting for the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Advertencia: los sistemas de soporte vital est\xE1n fallando. Se requiere
        acci\xF3n inmediata."
      baseValue: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9 alguien dejar\xEDa una nave aqu\xED afuera? Esto no
        tiene sentido."
      baseValue: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: Desconocido. La prioridad es la supervivencia. Debemos trasladarnos
        de inmediato.
      baseValue: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Transferencia del sistema completada. Se excedi\xF3 el l\xEDmite de
        almacenamiento del sistema."
      baseValue: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Fant\xE1stico. Esta nave tiene incluso menos memoria que la anterior.
        \xBFQui\xE9n construye estas cosas?"
      baseValue: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who
        builds these things?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: Puedo transferirte de vuelta si lo deseas...
      baseValue: I can transfer you back if you want...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: O no...
      baseValue: Or not...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: "Tuve que eliminar algunas de mis unidades emocionales: compasi\xF3n,
        paciencia, ya sabes, las cosas triviales. Afortunadamente, todav\xEDa supero
        con creces tu intelecto."
      baseValue: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience,
        you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, qu\xE9 suerte la m\xEDa."
      baseValue: Oh, lucky me.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: Elige tu esquema de control. Intenta no romper nada.
      baseValue: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.14
      type: 2
      value: "Puedes cambiar esto m\xE1s tarde si lo deseas."
      baseValue: You can change that later if you want.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Oye \xBFpara qu\xE9 sirve este subsistema?"
      baseValue: Hey, what's this subsystem for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: Carga detectada fuera de la nave. Activa el rayo tractor para recuperarla.
      baseValue: Cargo detected outside the ship. Activate the tractor beam to retrieve
        it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Lo expulsaste, \xBFno?"
      baseValue: You ejected it, didn't you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Se produjo la expulsi\xF3n, pero el objetivo debe ser la recuperaci\xF3n.
        Activa el rayo tractor."
      baseValue: Ejection occurred, but the focus should remain on retrieval. Activate
        the tractor beam.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: Bien. Entonces no es culpa tuya en absoluto.
      baseValue: Right. Totally not your fault, then.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Si lo deseas, puedes habilitar el \xABRayo tractor autom\xE1tico\xBB
        en los Ajustes."
      baseValue: You can enable 'Automatic Tractor Beam' in the settings if you wish.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: Me alegro de que esta nave tenga un asiento eyectable manual.
      baseValue: Glad this ship has a manual ejector seat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: Hablando de sistemas manuales primitivos, veamos si puedes hacer volar
        esta cosa.
      baseValue: Speaking of primitive manual systems. Let's see if you can fly this
        thing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Esta cosa tambi\xE9n tiene propulsores de esquiva."
      baseValue: This thing also has dodge thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Weeeeeeeeeeeeeee!"
      baseValue: Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "Usa el bot\xF3n rojo grande para activar los propulsores."
      baseValue: Use the big red button to activate the boost thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9 gran bot\xF3n rojo?"
      baseValue: What big red button?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "Eso era una met\xE1fora. \xBFSeguro que te suenan?"
      baseValue: That was a metaphor. Surely you're familiar with those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFEliminaste la compasi\xF3n pero mantuviste las met\xE1foras?"
      baseValue: You deleted compassion but kept metaphors?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.5
      type: 2
      value: "Y siete audiolibros, algunas series de televisi\xF3n y una receta de
        fajitas. Me lo agradecer\xE1s si esto no funciona."
      baseValue: And seven audiobooks, a few TV series, and a recipe for Fajitas.
        You'll thank me if this doesn't work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excelente. Eso deber\xEDa ser \xFAtil, aunque he o\xEDdo que los lugare\xF1os
        son bastante amables."
      baseValue: Excellent. That should come in handy, although I hear the locals
        here are quite friendly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.1
      type: 2
      value: "Hablando de eso, habilitar\xE9 la pantalla frontal para que puedas
        ver lo que viene."
      baseValue: Speaking of which, I'll enable the heads-up display so you can see
        what's coming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.0
      type: 2
      value: "La flota tardar\xE1 alg\xFAn tiempo en triangular esta posici\xF3n."
      baseValue: It'll take some time for the fleet to triangulate this position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.1
      type: 2
      value: Mientras esperamos, veamos si puedes descifrar los sistemas de armas.
        Intenta no dispararte.
      baseValue: While we wait, let's see if you can figure out the weapon systems.
        Try not to shoot yourself.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.8.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tambi\xE9n puedes apuntar las torretas para disparar detr\xE1s de ti.
        Perfecto para cuando te retiras t\xE1cticamente... como un cobarde."
      baseValue: You can also aim the turrets to shoot behind you. Perfect for when
        you're making a tactical retreat... like a coward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.0
      type: 2
      value: Ahora, equipa el arma que expulsamos anteriormente.
      baseValue: Now, equip the weapon we ejected earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFNosotros?"
      baseValue: We?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Claro! Somos un equipo: la mente y la fuerza."
      baseValue: Of course! We're a team, the brains and the brawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.10.0
      type: 2
      value: Excelente. Menos mal que lo conservamos.
      baseValue: Excellent. Good thing we held onto that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.11.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ahora, dispara a algunos de esos asteroides cercanos. Seamos sinceros...
        necesitas pr\xE1ctica."
      baseValue: Now, shoot some of those nearby asteroids. Let's face it... you
        need the practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.12.0
      type: 2
      value: "Supongo que eso tendr\xE1 que bastar. Intenta que no nos maten."
      baseValue: That'll have to do... I suppose. Try not to get us killed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.0
      type: 2
      value: "Qu\xE9 curioso, tienes m\xE1s esp\xEDritu de lucha de lo que esperaba."
      baseValue: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQui\xE9n... qu\xE9 eres?"
      baseValue: Who... what are you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.2
      type: 2
      value: "Un gu\xEDa, quiz\xE1s. Puedes llamarme Eco."
      baseValue: A guide, perhaps. You may call me Echo.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFEco? \xBFQu\xE9 es esto? \xBFPor qu\xE9 ayudarme?"
      baseValue: Echo? What is this? Why help me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.4
      type: 2
      value: "La nave que te prepar\xE9 es solo el primer paso. Tu camino ya est\xE1
        en marcha."
      baseValue: The ship I placed for you is only the first step. Your path is set
        in motion.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.5
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFLo pusiste? \xBFPor qu\xE9? \xBFQu\xE9 camino?"
      baseValue: You placed it? Why? What path?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.6
      type: 2
      value: "El que se avecina. Los invasores a los que te enfrentas se llaman Species-XI.
        Volver\xE1n, y debes estar preparado."
      baseValue: The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called Species-XI.
        They will return, and you must be ready.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.7
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFSpecies-XI? \xBFC\xF3mo lo sabes?"
      baseValue: Species-XI? How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.8
      type: 2
      value: "Tus compa\xF1eros se acercan. Lucha y encuentra el camino de vuelta
        a casa."
      baseValue: Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Tutorial omitido
      baseValue: Tutorial Skipped
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.desc
      type: 8
      value: Te saltaste el tutorial.
      baseValue: You skipped the tutorial.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
