    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Incluso la flora, tan desesperada por preservar la naturaleza, se aferr\xF3
        a reliquias que apenas comprend\xEDa."
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Otra pieza reclamada... el dise\xF1o se vuelve m\xE1s claro con cada
        una."
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: Mjolnir
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "T\xFA otra vez... \xBFPara qu\xE9 recoges estas piezas?"
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esto no es tecnolog\xEDa Phantom. Fue creada por los Architects...
        los que sembraron vida entre las estrellas."
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Antes de que perdieran su prop\xF3sito... y desaparecieran en su propia
        luz."
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Lo reclamo por un prop\xF3sito superior. Cuando llegue el momento,
        lo ver\xE1s."
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
