    - key: faction.Conclave.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "El \xFAltimo gran imperio humano, unificado bajo el Emperador despu\xE9s
        de que las guerras planetarias casi exterminaran a la humanidad. Su gobierno
        militarista valora el orden, la estabilidad y la fuerza por encima de todo.
        Los ciudadanos viven vidas pr\xF3speras apoyadas por IA avanzada y automatizaci\xF3n,
        con servicio militar obligatorio para cada adulto. El Conclave se ve a s\xED
        mismo como el escudo de la humanidad contra una galaxia hostil."
      baseValue: "The last great human empire, unified under the Emperor after the
        planetary wars nearly wiped humanity out. Its militaristic government values
        order, stability, and strength above all else. Citizens live prosperous lives
        supported by advanced AI and automation, with mandatory military service
        for every adult. The Conclave sees itself as humanity\u2019s shield against
        a hostile galaxy."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Skeran.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Una raza brutal impulsada por la conquista, la jerarqu\xEDa y la expansi\xF3n
        sin fin. Sus flotas abruman a los enemigos mediante pura agresi\xF3n y n\xFAmeros
        aplastantes. Los Skeran fueron creados y manipulados originalmente por los
        Phantoms como armas vivientes. Incontables camadas siguen ocultas m\xE1s
        all\xE1 del espacio explorado."
      baseValue: A brutal race driven by conquest, hierarchy, and endless expansion.
        Their fleets overwhelm enemies through sheer aggression and overwhelming
        numbers. The Skeran were originally created and manipulated by the Phantoms
        as living weapons. Countless broods still remain hidden beyond explored space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Phantom.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Una especie antigua y sumamente avanzada que considera primitivas y
        autodestructivas a las civilizaciones m\xE1s j\xF3venes. Desprecian el militarismo
        del Conclave y favorecen al Pantheon por su diplomacia. Los Phantoms son
        reservados, manipuladores y pacientes m\xE1s all\xE1 de la comprensi\xF3n
        mortal. Gran parte del sufrimiento de la galaxia puede rastrearse hasta su
        interferencia."
      baseValue: "An ancient and highly advanced species that views younger civilizations
        as primitive and self-destructive. They despise the Conclave\u2019s militarism
        and favor the Pantheon for its diplomacy. The Phantoms are secretive, manipulative,
        and patient beyond mortal understanding. Much of the galaxy\u2019s suffering
        can be traced back to their interference."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Flora.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Una especie vegetal sintiente que evolucion\xF3 de forma independiente
        a la vida animal dentro del Sector 3. Ven a las civilizaciones de origen
        animal como par\xE1sitos violentos que corrompen el orden natural. Ferozmente
        protectores de su territorio, los Flora responden con agresividad ante cualquier
        intrusi\xF3n en sus mundos. Para ellos, la industria y la expansi\xF3n son
        enfermedades que tarde o temprano deben ser purgadas."
      baseValue: A sentient plant species that evolved independently from animal
        life within Sector 3. They see animal-based civilizations as violent parasites
        corrupting the natural order. Fiercely protective of their territory, the
        Flora respond aggressively to any intrusion into their worlds. To them, industry
        and expansion are diseases that must eventually be purged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Species-XI.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Entidades horrorosas del vac\xEDo m\xE1s all\xE1 de los portales. Se
        propagan como una infecci\xF3n, corrompiendo naves, tecnolog\xEDa y criaturas
        vivientes. Simplemente aparecen y comienzan a destruir todo a su paso, sin
        que se haya observado jam\xE1s un intento de comunicaci\xF3n. Se entiende
        muy poco sobre su verdadera naturaleza, ya que la mayor\xEDa de los enfrentamientos
        terminan en aniquilaci\xF3n total."
      baseValue: Horrific entities from the void beyond the gateways. They spread
        like an infection, corrupting ships, technology, and living creatures. They
        simply appear and begin destroying everything in their path, with no attempts
        at communication ever observed. Very little is understood about their true
        nature, as most encounters end in total annihilation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Grays.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Misteriosos extraterrestres obsesionados con la experimentaci\xF3n
        gen\xE9tica y la perfecci\xF3n biol\xF3gica. Evitan la guerra abierta, dependiendo
        en cambio de abducciones, observaci\xF3n y manipulaci\xF3n encubierta. Los
        enfrentamientos con los Grays son raros, cl\xEDnicos y profundamente perturbadores,
        y las v\xEDctimas suelen desaparecer sin explicaci\xF3n. La mayor\xEDa de
        las civilizaciones desestima las historias sobre ellos como teor\xEDas de
        conspiraci\xF3n hasta que les sucede a ellos mismos."
      baseValue: Mysterious extraterrestrials obsessed with genetic experimentation
        and biological perfection. They avoid open warfare, instead relying on abductions,
        observation, and covert manipulation. Encounters with the Grays are rare,
        clinical, and deeply unsettling, with victims often disappearing without
        explanation. Most civilizations dismiss stories about them as conspiracy
        theories until they are taken themselves.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Neutral.backstory
      type: 8
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Forgotten.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Una facci\xF3n renegada de Phantoms que rechaz\xF3 el declive de su
        especie y abraz\xF3 la dominaci\xF3n. Se creen superiores a toda otra forma
        de vida y buscan esclavizar a las civilizaciones m\xE1s d\xE9biles. Los Forgotten
        interfieren abiertamente y manipulan a las razas m\xE1s j\xF3venes dondequiera
        que las encuentran. Sus mundos est\xE1n repletos de tecnolog\xEDa antigua
        retorcida hasta convertirse en herramientas de control."
      baseValue: A rogue faction of Phantoms who rejected the decline of their species
        and embraced domination instead. They believe themselves superior to all
        other life and seek to enslave weaker civilizations. The Forgotten openly
        interfere with and manipulate younger races wherever they find them. Their
        worlds are filled with ancient technology twisted into tools of control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Shadow.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Unidades de infiltraci\xF3n Skeran especializadas, creadas por los
        Phantoms para el sabotaje y la guerra encubierta. Atacan desde la oscuridad,
        emboscando objetivos y robando tecnolog\xEDa antes de desvanecerse de nuevo.
        Sus naves son veloces, depredadoras y dise\xF1adas para sembrar tanto miedo
        como destrucci\xF3n. Incluso otros Skeran los miran con inquietud."
      baseValue: Specialized Skeran infiltration units created by the Phantoms for
        sabotage and covert warfare. They strike from darkness, ambushing targets
        and stealing technology before disappearing again. Their ships are fast,
        predatory, and designed to spread fear as much as destruction. Even other
        Skeran regard them with unease.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Junker.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Piratas, desertores y carro\xF1eros que viven dentro de los cinturones
        de asteroides fundidos del Sector 1. La mayor\xEDa son antiguos ciudadanos
        del Conclave que abandonaron la vida militar y ahora sobreviven mediante
        el saqueo y el contrabando. Sus naves est\xE1n ensambladas con tecnolog\xEDa
        robada y rescatada, sostenidas por pura desesperaci\xF3n. En territorio Junker,
        la supervivencia importa m\xE1s que la lealtad o la ley."
      baseValue: Pirates, deserters, and scavengers living within the molten asteroid
        belts of Sector 1. Most are former Conclave citizens who abandoned military
        life and now survive through raiding and smuggling. Their ships are assembled
        from stolen and salvaged technology held together through desperation. In
        Junker territory, survival matters more than loyalty or law.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Outcast.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Humanos enloquecidos por el uso excesivo de tecnolog\xEDas experimentales
        como los Motores temporales. Sus mentes se han fracturado hasta el punto
        de creerse iluminados, dotados de verdades que el resto de la humanidad no
        puede comprender. Sus naves se mueven de forma impredecible en combate, atravesando
        fases y distorsionando el tiempo mismo. Incluso el Conclave teme en lo que
        se han convertido los Outcasts."
      baseValue: Humans driven mad through overuse of experimental technologies such
        as Temporal Drives. Their minds have fractured to the point that they believe
        themselves enlightened, gifted with truths the rest of humanity cannot grasp.
        Their ships move unpredictably through combat, phasing and distorting time
        itself. Even the Conclave fears what the Outcasts have become.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Pantheon.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Descendientes de desertores del Conclave que huyeron de la Tierra para
        construir una sociedad democr\xE1tica libre del dominio imperial. Creen que
        el Conclave se ha obsesionado con la guerra y el control, sacrificando el
        futuro de la humanidad en el proceso. Sus ideales pac\xEDficos les valieron
        una alianza con los antiguos Phantoms, otorg\xE1ndoles acceso a tecnolog\xEDa
        poderosa. El Pantheon se ve a s\xED mismo como el futuro de la humanidad."
      baseValue: "Descendants of Conclave defectors who fled Earth to build a democratic
        society free from imperial rule. They believe the Conclave has become obsessed
        with war and control, sacrificing humanity\u2019s future in the process.
        Their peaceful ideals earned them an alliance with the ancient Phantoms,
        granting access to powerful technology. The Pantheon sees itself as the future
        of mankind."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Sentinel.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Defensores de \xE9lite de la Tierra y fuerzas militares personales
        del Emperador. Sirven directamente bajo el Gran Mariscal Vex, actuando como
        guardia real. Sus flotas est\xE1n fuertemente armadas, son disciplinadas
        y completamente implacables en batalla. La llegada de las fuerzas Sentinel
        suele significar que la situaci\xF3n ya se ha vuelto cr\xEDtica."
      baseValue: "Elite defenders of Earth and the Emperor\u2019s personal military
        forces. They serve directly under Grand Marshal Vex, acting as royal guard.
        Their fleets are heavily armed, disciplined, and completely unforgiving in
        battle. The arrival of Sentinel forces usually means the situation has already
        become critical."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog1
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Por fin! Estamos cargando el hiperimpulsor. \xA1Ay\xFAdanos a contenerlos!"
      baseValue: Finally! We're charging the hyperdrive, help hold them off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog2
      type: 2
      value: "Gracias al Emperador. Saldremos de aqu\xED enseguida. \xA1Solo cont\xE9nganlos!"
      baseValue: Thank the Emperor. We'll be out of here in no time just hold them
        off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog3
      type: 2
      value: "Tenemos m\xE1s hostiles en camino. \xA1Cuidado!"
      baseValue: We have more hostiles incoming. Watch out!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog4
      type: 2
      value: "Se est\xE1n preparando para un ataque mayor. \xA1Prep\xE1rense!"
      baseValue: They're gearing up for a bigger attack. Get ready!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1s invadiendo espacio Skeran. \xA1M\xE1rchate ahora o ser\xE1s
        destruido!"
      baseValue: You are trespassing in Skeran space. Leave now, or be destroyed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Directo a las amenazas. Encantador.
      baseValue: Straight to the threats. Charming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "No est\xE1n fanfarroneando."
      baseValue: They're not bluffing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "No, no lo son. Prep\xE1rense..."
      baseValue: No, they're not. Get ready...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Impresionante. Has luchado hasta aqu\xED, pero tendr\xE1s que luchar
        m\xE1s duro para llegar a la Tierra."
      baseValue: Impressive. You've fought your way this far, but you'll need to
        fight harder to reach Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Considera esto una muestra de mi... apoyo.
      baseValue: Consider this a token of my... support.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9? \xBFPor qu\xE9 ayudarnos?"
      baseValue: Why? Why help us?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFAyuda? No. Estoy gestionando una variable. T\xFA solo resultas
        beneficiado."
      baseValue: Help? No. I'm managing a variable. You just happen to benefit.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.4
      type: 2
      value: Solo tienes un camino. Lucha para avanzar.
      baseValue: You have only one path. Fight your way forward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tus victorias no significan nada. \xA1Seremos victoriosos!"
      baseValue: Your wins mean nothing. We will be victorious!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.1
      type: 2
      value: Parece que no tienen fin...
      baseValue: There seems to be no end to them...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.2
      type: 2
      value: Son implacables, una raza guerrera creada para la guerra.
      baseValue: They're relentless, a warrior race built for war.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFTe atreves a desafiar el poder de los Skeran? \xA1Nunca llegar\xE1s
        a la Ciudadela!"
      baseValue: You dare challenge the might of the Skeran? You will never reach
        the Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Los Phantom no pudieron derrotarnos, y t\xFA tampoco lo har\xE1s!"
      baseValue: The Phantoms could not defeat us, neither will you!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "Grandes palabras para una especie que est\xE1 a punto de perder otra
        pelea."
      baseValue: Big words for a species about to lose another fight.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Maldita sea, se prepara una emboscada...
      baseValue: Damn, an ambush prepare to...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9... qu\xE9 acaba de pasar?"
      baseValue: What... what just happened?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Eso ni siquiera lo registraron nuestros sensores. \xBFQu\xE9 tipo de
        poder est\xE1 usando?"
      baseValue: That didn't even register on our sensors. What kind of power is
        she using?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "T\xF3malo como una recompensa por elegir el camino m\xE1s dif\xEDcil."
      baseValue: Take this as a reward for choosing the harder path.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9 haces esto?"
      baseValue: Why are you doing this?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.5
      type: 2
      value: Digamos que este camino nos beneficia a ambos.
      baseValue: Let's just say this path benefits us both.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFDe verdad esperas que confiemos en eso?"
      baseValue: You really expect us to trust that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.7
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFConfianza? No. Pero el siguiente paso est\xE1 claro. Tu camino
        a casa est\xE1 plagado de enemigos, y necesitar\xE1s algo m\xE1s que preguntas
        para sobrevivir."
      baseValue: Trust? No. But the next step is clear. Your way home is littered
        with enemies, and you'll need more than questions to survive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "El Conclave vuelve, aferr\xE1ndose a sus viejas costumbres. \xBFNunca
        van a aprender?"
      baseValue: The Conclave returns, clinging to its old ways. Will you ever learn?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Los Phantom son exactamente lo que esperar\xEDas de una raza inmortal.
        Arrogantes, condescendientes... amantes de los mon\xF3logos."
      baseValue: Phantoms are exactly what you'd expect from an immortal race. Arrogant,
        condescending... fond of monologues.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "No nos est\xE1n invitando exactamente a tomar el t\xE9, \xBFverdad?"
      baseValue: Not exactly inviting us to tea, are they?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Los de tu especie solo conocen la guerra. No permitiremos que la traigan
        aqu\xED."
      baseValue: Your kind knows only war. We will not let you bring it here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Quienes construyeron los portales nunca comprendieron el sufrimiento
        que traer\xEDan."
      baseValue: The ones who built the gateways never understood the suffering they'd
        bring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFSufrimiento? \xBFPor los Portales?"
      baseValue: Suffering? From the Gateways?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Recorrieron las estrellas y solo encontraron silencio... as\xED que
        crearon vida para llenar el vac\xEDo."
      baseValue: They scoured the stars and found only silence... so they made life
        to fill the emptiness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Pero sus preciados portales iluminaron el vac\xEDo... cegando a lo
        que nunca debi\xF3 ver la luz."
      baseValue: But their precious gateways lit up the void... blinding what should
        never have seen the light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.0
      type: 2
      value: Hemos visto surgir y caer innumerables civilizaciones, y sus cenizas
        esparcidas por las estrellas.
      baseValue: We have seen countless civilizations rise and fall, their ashes
        scattered across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "El Conclave no ser\xE1 diferente."
      baseValue: The Conclave will be no different.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.2
      type: 2
      value: Suenas como si hubieras existido desde siempre.
      baseValue: You sound like you've been around forever.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos visto el nacimiento y la muerte de las estrellas, la ca\xEDda
        de tiranos que se cre\xEDan eternos."
      baseValue: We have watched the birth and death of stars, the fall of tyrants
        who thought themselves eternal.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "No creas que nos vas a quebrantar tan f\xE1cilmente como lo hiciste
        con nuestras desobedientes mascotas."
      baseValue: Do not think you will break us as easily as you did our disobedient
        pets.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.5
      type: 2
      value: "Entonces ponnos en tu lista de ca\xEDdos... y mira lo que pasa despu\xE9s."
      baseValue: Then put us on your list of fallen... and watch what happens next.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Necesitar\xE1s esto."
      baseValue: You'll need this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFPor qu\xE9?"
      baseValue: Why?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Esta no es la parte donde mueres. Eso viene despu\xE9s."
      baseValue: This isn't the part where you die. That comes later.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Encantador...
      baseValue: Delightful...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Al menos ya no habla con acertijos!"
      baseValue: At least it's not speaking in riddles anymore!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.0
      type: 2
      value: Ejerces el poder sin comprender su costo.
      baseValue: You wield power without understanding its cost.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.1
      type: 2
      value: Hemos manejado todo lo que nos han arrojado hasta ahora.
      baseValue: We've handled everything you've thrown at us so far.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1S\xF3lo porque lo permitimos!"
      baseValue: Only because we allow it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.3
      type: 2
      value: "Los Skeran fueron nuestras creaciones... hubo otras, mucho m\xE1s grandiosas,
        perdidas en el tiempo."
      baseValue: The Skeran were our creations... there were others, far greater,
        lost to time
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.4
      type: 2
      value: "Luchas por el control de una galaxia que nosotros moldeamos, sin cuestionar
        jam\xE1s las ruinas bajo tus pies."
      baseValue: You fight for control of a galaxy we shaped, never questioning the
        ruins beneath your feet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Retrocede, animal. No traigas aqu\xED a la Invocadora del Vac\xEDo."
      baseValue: Turn back, animal. Do not bring the Void Caller here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFY qui\xE9n es esa exactamente?"
      baseValue: And who exactly is that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.2
      type: 2
      value: Sus secuaces te persiguen ahora mismo. Te eliminaremos antes de que
        lleguen.
      baseValue: Her minions pursue you even now. We will remove you before they
        arrive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Encontr\xE9 esto."
      baseValue: I found this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, \xBFnos est\xE1s ayudando otra vez?"
      baseValue: Oh, you're helping us again?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Solo, fracasabas. Juntos a\xFAn podemos avanzar."
      baseValue: Alone, you floundered. Together we may yet make progress.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1 juzgando tu punter\xEDa porque tu punter\xEDa es mala..."
      baseValue: It's judging your aiming because your aiming is bad...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tu contaminaci\xF3n se extiende por nuestro jard\xEDn."
      baseValue: Your pollution spreads throughout our garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFContaminaci\xF3n? Tengo estos propulsores funcionando a casi el
        0,5 % de emisiones..."
      baseValue: Pollution? I've got these thrusters running at nearly 0.5% emissions...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Creo que era una met\xE1fora. Pens\xE9 que las entend\xEDas."
      baseValue: I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ah, cierto, somos la contaminaci\xF3n... \xA1entiendo!"
      baseValue: Oh right, we're the pollution... got it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nave del Conclave, nos alegraste el d\xEDa. Apaga los motores y lo
        haremos r\xE1pido."
      baseValue: Conclave ship, you just made our day. Power down and we'll make
        this quick.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Encantador. Piratas con ambici\xF3n... y cero instinto de supervivencia."
      baseValue: Lovely. Pirates with ambition... and zero self-preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Quemaste a nuestra tripulaci\xF3n. Estamos aqu\xED para devolverte
        el favor... con intereses."
      baseValue: You torched our crew. We're here to return the favor... with interest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Otra vez estos cabezas huecas. \xBFReaparecen o solo se multiplican?"
      baseValue: Not these meatheads again. Do they respawn, or just multiply?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "He caminado por el ayer... y he vuelto desde el ma\xF1ana."
      baseValue: I have walked through yesterday... and returned from tomorrow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fant\xE1stico. Adictos temporales con complejo de dios."
      baseValue: Fantastic. Temporal junkies with a god complex.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9 es lo que buscan?"
      baseValue: What are they even after?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Trascendencia... o tal vez una sesi\xF3n de meditaci\xF3n grupal al
        final de los tiempos."
      baseValue: Transcendence... or maybe a group meditation session at the end
        of time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Est\xE1s atrapado en el presente... y el futuro ya no te quiere."
      baseValue: You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer wants
        you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Eso es la Deriva Temporal hablando. Tienen la mente confusa.
      baseValue: That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Te o\xEDmos, fantasma tictaqueante! \xA1Tus pensamientos lineales
        delatan tu debilidad!"
      baseValue: We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts betray your weakness!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Espera... \xBFpueden o\xEDrme? As\xED no deber\xEDa funcionar."
      baseValue: Wait... they can hear me? That's not how this is supposed to work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Hemos salido de tu tiempo. No puedes atrapar lo que ya sucedi\xF3."
      baseValue: We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already
        happened.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Vagas donde la luz no llega... y no ves lo que sigue.
      baseValue: You wander where the light does not reach... and do not see what
        follows.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Cr\xEDptico y desconcertante. Justo lo que esperaba."
      baseValue: Cryptic and unsettling. Just what I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.2
      type: 2
      value: La caza ya ha terminado.
      baseValue: The hunt is already over.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.3
      type: 2
      value: Creo que es su manera de decir que estamos en problemas.
      baseValue: I think that's their way of saying we're in trouble.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Este conocimiento nunca fue pensado para ti.
      baseValue: This knowledge was never meant for you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Suena como si estuvieran carro\xF1eando... probablemente tecnolog\xEDa
        Phantom."
      baseValue: Sounds like they're scavenging... probably Phantom tech.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xA1Genial! M\xE1s armas robadas para usarlas contra nosotros."
      baseValue: Great. More stolen weapons to turn against us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Una nave solitaria... extraviada por fuerzas que escapan a su comprensi\xF3n."
      baseValue: A lone ship... led astray by forces beyond their understanding.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ni siquiera s\xE9 qui\xE9n eres..."
      baseValue: I don't even know who you are...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.2
      type: 2
      value: Claro que no. Tus amos borran muchas cosas de tu historia.
      baseValue: Of course you don't. Your masters erase many things from your history.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nos alejamos de su tiran\xEDa. Ahora caminamos con verdaderos poderes."
      baseValue: We walked away from their tyranny. Now we stand with true powers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFLos Phantom? Cambiaste un amo por otro..."
      baseValue: Phantoms? You traded one master for another...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Un maestro exige obediencia... un mentor comparte sabidur\xEDa."
      baseValue: A master demands obedience... a mentor shares wisdom.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "El fantasma del vac\xEDo puede llevarte a casa... pero no para tu bien."
      baseValue: The ghost from the void may lead you home... but not for your sake.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFQu\xE9 sabes de los fantasmas?"
      baseValue: What do you know of ghosts?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Que incluso los m\xE1s viejos entre nosotros sabemos que hay que temer
        a la oscuridad."
      baseValue: That even the oldest among us know to fear the darkness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Entras en sombras antiguas, pe\xF3n del Conclave."
      baseValue: You step into ancient shadows, Conclave pawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFM\xE1s Phantom? No suenas como los dem\xE1s."
      baseValue: More Phantoms? You don't sound like the rest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "No somos sus restos. Somos su perfecci\xF3n."
      baseValue: We are not their remnants. We are their perfection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Arrod\xEDllate o ser\xE1s deshecho."
      baseValue: Kneel, or be unmade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Llevas las cadenas de tus amos como medallas.
      baseValue: You wear your masters' chains like medals.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Mejor que adorar las ruinas de un imperio fallido.
      baseValue: Better than worshipping the ruins of a failed empire.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "No solo est\xE1n enga\xF1ados... son nost\xE1lgicos y peligrosos."
      baseValue: They're not just deluded... they're nostalgic and dangerous.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.3
      type: 2
      value: No veneramos el pasado. Lo corregimos.
      baseValue: We do not worship the past. We correct it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nave humana. Estructura gen\xE9tica confirmada. Prep\xE1rense para
        la recolecci\xF3n."
      baseValue: Human vessel. Genetic structure confirmed. Prepare for collection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Espera. \xBFEsto es... realmente nos est\xE1n secuestrando?"
      baseValue: Wait. Is this... are we actually getting abducted?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Grays. Claro, son los Grays. Deb\xED haber tra\xEDdo un sombrero de
        papel aluminio."
      baseValue: Grays. Of course, it's Grays. Should've brought a tinfoil hat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "No te resistas. El cumplimiento garantiza p\xE9rdida m\xEDnima de tejido."
      baseValue: Do not resist. Compliance ensures minimal tissue loss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "El sujeto sigue sin cumplir. Procediendo con el protocolo de contenci\xF3n
        secundaria."
      baseValue: Subject remains noncompliant. Proceeding with secondary containment
        protocol.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "\xBFEn serio siguen intentando secuestrarme?"
      baseValue: You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "S\xED. Y a juzgar por el pico del esc\xE1ner... trajeron un frasco
        m\xE1s grande."
      baseValue: They are. And judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger
        jar.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Da\xF1o tisular aceptable. Comiencen la cosecha."
      baseValue: Tissue damage acceptable. Begin harvest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
